{"id":"352086974","kind":"article","title":"谬误：睡前学习是最好的","author":"Piotr Wozniak","original_authors":["Piotr Wozniak"],"original_source_urls":["https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Myth:_Learning_before_sleep_is_best"],"publisher":"Thoughts Memo","column":"睡眠研究 & 生活建议","date":"2021-02-22","updated":"2026-10-27","votes":58,"comment_count":3,"minutes":1,"chars":471,"keywords":["睡眠","昼夜节律","记忆巩固","注意力","学习时机"],"summary":"译文质疑“睡前学习最好”的说法。文章承认睡眠有助于记忆巩固，但转述原作者的主张：对健康者而言清晨可能更适合学习，因为警觉性及注意力与创造力的调节状态较佳；夜间较少干扰的潜在好处不一定足以抵消这些因素。对于早晨难以学习的 DSPS 患者，文中建议关注睡眠问题，而非把夜间学习直接视为理想方案。","zhihu_url":"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/352086974","restoration":null,"toc":[{"id":"sec-1","level":2,"title":"谬误"},{"id":"sec-2","level":2,"title":"事实"}],"html":"<blockquote data-pid=\"NFnLRePy\">原文：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Myth:_Learning_before_sleep_is_best\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Myth: Learning before sleep is best - supermemo.guru</a></blockquote><h2 id=\"sec-1\"><b>谬误</b></h2><p data-pid=\"Gtw7UVZR\">一则流传甚广的谬误说：<b>睡前学习新事物</b>。据称，睡前学到的东西在一夜之间得到了最好的巩固。的确，睡眠对于巩固记忆是必不可少的（参见：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Sleep_and_learning\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">睡眠和学习</a>）。然而，睡前学习并不是最理想的。</p><h2 id=\"sec-2\"><b>事实</b></h2><p data-pid=\"4KGzC_Ei\">事实恰恰相反。对于一个健康的人来说，学习的最佳时间是清晨。许多学生患有 DSPS，根本无法在早上学习。他们太昏昏欲睡了。在深夜的宁静中，他们的头脑似乎最清醒。他们可能确实会通过夜间学习获得更好的结果，但他们更应该尝试解决睡眠问题，例如<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Free_running_sleep\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">自由运行睡眠</a>（参见：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Curing_DSPS_and_insomnia\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">治疗 DSPS 和失眠</a>）。夜间学习可以减少记忆<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Interference\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">干扰</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup>，即白天获得的新知识对所学材料的清除。然而，一个更为重要的因素是大脑在学习过程中的神经激素状态。从这个意义上说，大脑最适合在早晨学习。它表现出最高的警觉性以及对<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Attention\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">注意力</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-2\"><a href=\"#ref-2\">[2]</a></sup>和<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Creativity\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">创造力</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-3\"><a href=\"#ref-3\">[3]</a></sup>之间平衡的最佳控制。在知识结构和处理速度方面的收获远远超过了深夜学习的所有次要优势（参见：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Natural_creativity_cycle\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">自然创造力循环</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-4\"><a href=\"#ref-4\">[4]</a></sup>）。</p><hr/><ol class=\"references\"><li id=\"ref-1\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-1\">↩</a> 干扰 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"269974053\" href=\"#/post/269974053\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-2\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-2\">↩</a> 注意力 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"650257646\" href=\"#/post/650257646\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-3\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-3\">↩</a> 创造力 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"450093869\" href=\"#/post/450093869\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-4\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-4\">↩</a> 自然创造力周期 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"68262875\" href=\"#/post/68262875\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li></ol>","rec_chain":[{"id":"426177682","title":"慢性压力","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":58,"minutes":2,"reason":"同专栏下一篇 · 睡眠研究 & 生活建议"},{"id":"68262875","title":"12 自然创造力周期","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":87,"minutes":24,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"450093869","title":"创造力","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":42,"minutes":6,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"269974053","title":"干扰","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":28,"minutes":1,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"650257646","title":"注意力","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":67,"minutes":2,"reason":"本文直接引用"}],"rec_bridge":[{"id":"721439557","title":"褪黑素：比你想知道的要多得多","author":"Scott Alexander","votes":146,"minutes":22,"reason":"跨作者共鸣「昼夜节律」· Scott Alexander"},{"id":"1950516755240817475","title":"「早起鸟」在打压「夜猫子」吗？","author":"Robin Hanson","votes":81,"minutes":3,"reason":"跨作者共鸣「昼夜节律」· Robin Hanson"}],"rec_answers":[{"id":"2083803987","title":"几点背单词更高效？你是「早派」还是「晚派」？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":28,"minutes":1,"reason":"核心节选引用 · 28 赞同","evidence":"目标作为回答末尾推荐阅读的 link-card 出现；正文提出的早晚复习问题没有采用译文关于清晨更利于健康者学习的观点。"}]}